    "intro_narrative": "You are an elite cyber-infiltrator trapped in the underground server bunker of the shadowy KRONOS Syndicate. Their rogue AI is minutes away from wiping your neural implants and deploying a devastating global financial blackout. The dimly lit room is a maze of blinking server racks, tangled fiber-optic cables, and standalone decryption terminals. To survive and abort the launch sequence, you must trace and manipulate the syndicate's fragmented data streams across various hardware modules. Your ultimate goal is to process the data correctly and feed it into the Final Overload Switch. The system is heavily fortified, and every piece of data must be routed through the precise sequence of quantum multipliers, protocol translators, and integrity validators. Time is running out.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
  },
